  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"----------png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:133px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA.png\" title=\"自动机.png (407 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:133px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/d/dc/%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/133?cb=20251024101212&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"自动机.png (407 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"自动机.png\" data-image-key=\"%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"自动机.png (407 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"自动机.png\" data-image-key=\"%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/d/dc/%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/133?cb=20251024101212&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】自动机\n</p><p>【初始区域】都市\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】4\n</p><p>【属性】 造物\n</p><p>【特性】无视该角色身上放置的移动牌\n</p><p>每轮回第二天及以后的每个回合开始阶段，将该角色移动到顺时针相邻的版图\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好3 1L1）选择该角色所在版图的一名角色和另一区域的1名角色，交换它们的位置（不能进行让角色交换至禁行区域的选择）\n</p><p>【感想】　挖，挖挖挖挖，挖掘机，挖掘机技术哪家强\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927033415\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []